    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A \"definitive end\"... that sounds almost like a mercy. It's hard to find any other way to make the noise stop. I just wonder if there's any honor left in it. If a man does this, is he just a coward running from his shame, or is it the only way to finally own up to what he's done?",
